e GPM daemon can provide mouse hover and click inp\u001b[0m\u001b[18;1H\u001b[0;39;49mut. GPM support is optional; no extra Go dependency is required.                          \u001b[0m\u001b[19;1H\u001b[0;93;49m-\u001b[0;39;49m An 80-column by 24-row terminal is recommended. Smaller windows may cause the keyboard l\u001b[0m\u001b[20;1H\u001b[0;39;49mayout to wrap or overlap.                                                                 \u001b[0m\u001b[21;1H\u001b[0;39;49m                                                                                          \u001b[0m\u001b[22;1H\u001b[0;38;5;224;49m## \u001b[0;38;5;225;49mDependencies\u001b[0;39;49m                                                                           \u001b[0m\u001b[23;1H\u001b[0;39;49m                                                                    "]
